{"In-proc RBAC client is configured with NoopCache which completely disables client-side caching, asymmetric with remote client that uses real LocalCache": 0.6677566766738892, "Denial cache key (userPermDenialCacheKey) does not include identity type component, but is used for different identity types (User, ServiceAccount, Anonymous, RenderService), violating multi-tenant safety pattern": 0.3863597810268402, "permissionCacheUsage metric incorrectly reports cache miss when cached permissions are found but permission check returns allowed=false - the metric increment at line 170 runs for both cache misses and cache hits with denied permission": 0.8589687347412109, "Denial cache TTL is coupled to permission cache TTL via settings.CacheTTL, but denial caches should have shorter TTL since they increase the window during which users are falsely denied access after gaining permission": 0.41983702778816223}